the trumpet vine.

278
00:22:22,260 --> 00:22:23,590
It blooms once every 10 years,

279
00:22:23,590 --> 00:22:25,650
and once it blooms, it never withers.

280
00:22:26,030 --> 00:22:27,750
If the sap from its petals

281
