enters the human body,

282
00:22:29,510 --> 00:22:31,240
it'll cause
imperceptible physical weakness,

283
00:22:31,240 --> 00:22:33,370
leading to gradual decline and death.

284
00:22:36,510 --> 00:22:37,440
It's poisonous.

285
00:22:38,680 --> 00:22:40,480
It really is the Gelsemium vine.

286
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:43,200
So the Grand Heir Apparent's
chronic illness

287
00:22:43,200 --> 00:22:44,240
was caused by someone

288
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:45,240
poisoning his food

289
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:46,750
with this Gelsemium vine.

290
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:48,440
After years of exposure,

291
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:50,310
his body finally gave out.

292
00:22:50,310 --> 00:22:51,880
I never expected to find Gelsemium vine

293
00:22:51,880 --> 00:22:53,740
in the Crown Prince's residence.

294
00:22:54,030 --> 00:22:56,510
It seems the culprit
behind Grand Heir Apparent's death...

295
00:22:56,510 --> 00:22:59,310
Was someone
within the Crown Prince's residence.

296
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:07,760
A little late to be guessing now,

297
00:23:07,960 --> 00:23:09,310
don't you think?

298
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:12,440
Grand Secretary,

299
00:23:13,440 --> 00:23:14,500
pardon my offense.

300
00:23:26,070 --> 00:23:27,730
The Heaven-Measuring Ruler?

301
00:24:07,350 --> 00:24:08,310
Eunuch Zhao?

302
00:24:09,510 --> 00:24:10,310
It's you.

303
00:24:17,350 --> 00:24:18,390
Li Si.

304
00:24:18,680 --> 00:24:20,790
You ruined my face.

305
00:24:23,030 --> 00:24:25,240
I was furious,

306
00:24:26,680 --> 00:24:28,160
but you were the future Emperor,

307
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:30,240
so I had no choice
but to swallow my anger.

308
00:24:30,240 --> 00:24:32,000
What a predicament.

309
00:24:32,400 --> 00:24:33,590
So that's how it is.

310
00:24:35,350 --> 00:24:36,830
No ordinary person could break into

311
00:24:36,830 --> 00:24:38,560
the Crown Prince's residence.

312
00:24:38,590 --> 00:24:40,000
And with a eunuch like you

313
00:24:40,440 --> 00:24:41,880
tasting Grand Heir Apparent's

314
00:24:41,880 --> 00:24:43,110
food first,

315
00:24:43,400 --> 00:24:45,590
how could he possibly have been poisoned?

316
00:24:45,590 --> 00:24:46,440
Unless

317
00:24:47,480 --> 00:24:49,340
you were the one who poisoned him.

318
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:51,240
And

319
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:54,070
what if I was?

320
00:24:55,270 --> 00:24:56,670
Now that I think about it,

321
00:24:56,880 --> 00:24:58,400
you were also the one
who helped Lou Tianming

322
00:24:58,400 --> 00:25:00,640
escape from the Divine Constable Bureau,

323
00:25:00,640 --> 00:25:01,880
weren't you?

324
00:25:02,830 --> 00:25:04,640
We did suspect

325
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:06,790
there was a mole within the Bureau,

326
00:25:06,790 --> 00:25:08,400
but we never imagined

327
00:25:08,830 --> 00:25:10,160
it would be you.

328
00:25:13,030 --> 00:25:15,690
You always disguised yourself
as incompetent,

329
00:25:16,400 --> 00:25:17,730
and Lou Tianming nearly

330
00:25:17,730 --> 00:25:19,110
bit one of your ears off.

331
00:25:19,750 --> 00:25:20,590
We truly

332
00:25:21,240 --> 00:25:22,440
would never

333
00:25:22,640 --> 00:25:24,790
have suspected you.

334
00:25:27,070 --> 00:25:29,030
So you're the Holy Lord of Liluo?

335
00:25:29,440 --> 00:25:30,880
Why ask so many questions

336
00:25:32,960 --> 00:25:34,720
when death is upon you?

337
00:25:34,750 --> 00:25:35,500
Eunuch Zhao,

338
00:25:35,530 --> 00:25:37,230
you seem awfully confident

339
00:25:37,440 --> 00:25:38,920
in your martial arts.

340
00:25:40,590 --> 00:25:43,190
If you still had
your Heaven-Measuring Ruler,

341
00:25:43,440 --> 00:25:45,550
I'd be somewhat wary of you.

342
00:25:46,750 --> 00:25:47,930
But now,

343
00:25:48,350 --> 00:25:49,400
apart from

344
00:25:49,400 --> 00:25:50,550
Xuanyuan Shan,

345
00:25:50,550 --> 00:25:51,400
there's no one

346
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:54,660
in the entire Divine Constable Bureau
I consider a threat.

347
00:25:55,440 --> 00:25:57,970
There're imperial guards
all over the place.

348
00:25:58,030 --> 00:25:59,880
All I have to do is shout,

349
00:26:00,240 --> 00:26:01,240
and we'll see

350
00:26:01,550 --> 00:26:03,280
how many of them you can take on.

351
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:08,830
Even if the place were surrounded
by a million soldiers,

352
00:26:08,830 --> 00:26:11,440
they could take my life,

353
00:26:12,680 --> 00:26:14,830
but they still couldn't save Bai Qi's.

354
00:26:21,750 --> 00:26:22,590
You misidentified Grand Secretary

355
00:26:22,590 --> 00:26:23,750
in the black chest case.

356
00:26:23,750 --> 00:26:26,350
And today, you've made
the same mistake again.

357
00:26:27,640 --> 00:26:28,510
Who are you?

358
00:26:43,750 --> 00:26:45,030
How could it be you?

359
00:26:48,790 --> 00:26:49,880
Where's Bai Qi?

360
00:26:50,200 --> 00:26:51,460
In the safest place

361
00:26:51,490 --> 00:26:52,950
under heavens, of course.

362
00:26:53,830 --> 00:26:54,830
Zhao Shanlei.

363
00:26:55,200 --> 00:26:57,110
You have no way out today.

364
00:26:58,070 --> 00:26:59,480
Just surrender.

365
00:26:59,680 --> 00:27:00,510
Li Si.

366
00:27:01,400 --> 00:27:03,000
Have you forgotten that

367
00:27:03,590 --> 00:27:06,450
you're still afflicted with
the Chiying Bug Venom?

368
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:15,310
You know what will happen

369
00:27:15,310 --> 00:27:16,350
once I shake this.

370
00:27:18,350 --> 00:27:20,210
Ten Thousand Gu Devouring Heart—

371
00:27:20,270 --> 00:27:22,200
making your life worse than death.

372
00:27:25,400 --> 00:27:26,350
Xuanyuan Shan.

373
00:27:27,960 --> 00:27:29,270
Even if you have immense power,

374
00:27:29,270 --> 00:27:31,730
you still can't cure
this Chiying Bug Venom.

375
00:27:31,830 --> 00:27:33,310
There are only 5 steps

376
00:27:34,750 --> 00:27:36,110
between you and me.

377
00:27:37,590 --> 00:27:39,990
Have you ever heard
of a kill within 5 steps?

378
00:27:40,960 --> 00:27:43,160
I may not be able to cure
the Chiying Bug Venom,

379
00:27:43,160 --> 00:27:44,730
but I'm certain

380
00:27:45,030 --> 00:27:46,440
that I can take your life

381
00:27:46,590 --> 00:27:48,110
within 5 steps.

382
00:28:25,480 --> 00:28:26,480
Yan...

383
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:33,750
Yan...

384
00:28:36,880 --> 00:28:38,050
Why?

385
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:41,240
Seventeen years ago,

386
00:28:42,590 --> 00:28:45,650
Father knew my eldest
and second brothers had set me up,

387
00:28:46,790 --> 00:28:48,640
yet he still buried the truth.

388
00:28:50,160 --> 00:28:51,490
Seventeen years later,

389
00:28:52,240 --> 00:28:54,440
just when we had finally been reunited,

390
00:28:55,640 --> 00:28:56,640
he learned that

391
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:59,040
I was afflicted with
the Chiying Bug Venom,

392
00:29:00,200 --> 00:29:01,400
and handed the throne to Third Brother

393
00:29:01,400 --> 00:29:03,400
without a moment's hesitation.

394
00:29:06,160 --> 00:29:07,790
Though I'd seen it coming,

395
00:29:09,590 --> 00:29:11,270
it still broke my heart.

396
00:29:16,200 --> 00:29:18,110
Did Father never consider

397
00:29:18,440 --> 00:29:20,570
how the people of Liluo would treat me,

398
00:29:21,160 --> 00:29:22,160
a discarded pawn,

399
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:25,200
if I could no longer inherit the throne?

400
00:29:29,790 --> 00:29:30,890
Li Qingyang.

401
00:29:32,030 --> 00:29:33,690
I know how cunning you are.

402
00:29:34,160 --> 00:29:36,680
Don't try to play tricks on me.

403
00:29:48,640 --> 00:29:49,590
Yan.

404
00:29:52,070 --> 00:29:53,680
It's not too late for you

405
00:29:55,030 --> 00:29:56,480
to turn back.

406
00:29:57,640 --> 00:29:58,510
Turn back?

407
00:30:02,200 --> 00:30:03,860
If turning back was an option,

408
00:30:04,680 --> 00:30:06,210
why didn't Father turn back

409
00:30:06,880 --> 00:30:08,680
17 years ago?

410
00:30:12,240 --> 00:30:13,920
Why didn't any of you?

411
00:30:39,830 --> 00:30:41,000
Chief Xuanyuan.

412
00:30:42,070 --> 00:30:43,280
You just said

413
00:30:43,590 --> 00:30:45,170
Grand Secretary Bai had already been

414
00:30:45,170 --> 00:30:47,430
taken into the Divine Constable Bureau.

415
00:30:47,480 --> 00:30:49,540
But there's one thing you don't know.

416
00:30:50,010 --> 00:30:51,550
Liluo still has

417
00:30:52,400 --> 00:30:53,960
a hidden piece in play

418
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:56,020
within the Divine Constable Bureau.

419
00:31:05,310 --> 00:31:06,310
Grand Secretary.

420
00:31:06,590 --> 00:31:08,160
Worrying now is useless.

421
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:09,960
You'd better sit down and rest.

422
00:31:09,960 --> 00:31:10,640
That's right, Grand Secretary.

423
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:11,880
I brought you some warm water.

424
00:31:11,880 --> 00:31:12,590
Please wash your face,

425
00:31:12,590 --> 00:31:13,920
and you'll feel better.

426
00:31:14,310 --> 00:31:15,110
Careful...

427
00:31:15,510 --> 00:31:16,450
Be careful.

428
00:31:16,570 --> 00:31:17,820
M-Mr. Yan.

429
00:31:19,220 --> 00:31:20,030
Let me do it.

430
00:31:21,880 --> 00:31:22,640
Grand Secretary.

431
00:31:22,640 --> 00:31:23,270
Here.

432
00:31:23,270 --> 00:31:24,200
Wash your hands.

433
00:31:30,470 --> 00:31:31,490
Grand Secretary!

434
00:31:47,070 --> 00:31:48,100
Grand Secretary!

435
00:31:48,790 --> 00:31:49,790
Grand Secretary!

436
00:31:53,680 --> 00:31:54,510
Why?

437
00:31:55,240 --> 00:31:56,710
Why did you do that?

438
00:31:59,400 --> 00:32:00,200
Mr. Yan.

439
00:32:00,350 --> 00:32:02,430
You don't understand.

440
00:32:03,030 --> 00:32:05,130
Holy Queen hasn't forgotten me.

441
00:32:05,800 --> 00:32:07,160
Three years in the shadows,

442
00:32:07,160 --> 00:32:08,790
all for this one moment of triumph.

443
00:32:08,790 --> 00:32:09,920
It was worth it.

444
00:32:11,070 --> 00:32:12,240
It was worth it.

445
00:32:13,640 --> 00:32:15,180
You're from Liluo?

446
00:32:16,070 --> 00:32:17,270
How is that possible?

447
00:32:18,960 --> 00:32:19,750
Tell me,

448
00:32:19,960 --> 00:32:21,440
who else is with you?

449
00:32:21,680 --> 00:32:22,550
Who else!

450
00:32:23,030 --> 00:32:24,130
Say it!

451
00:32:37,400 --> 00:32:38,620
Our people

452
00:32:40,880 --> 00:32:42,000
are everywhere.

453
00:32:42,590 --> 00:32:43,720
Everywhere...

454
00:32:45,300 --> 00:32:46,620
Everywhere...

455
00:33:11,400 --> 00:33:13,350
Who else?

456
00:33:15,240 --> 00:33:17,680
Who else!

457
00:33:19,000 --> 00:33:21,310
Bai Qi is already dead.

458
00:33:23,000 --> 00:33:25,110
You want to forge the posthumous edict

459
00:33:25,110 --> 00:33:25,860
and make Yan

460
00:33:25,880 --> 00:33:27,000
your puppet emperor?

461
00:33:27,000 --> 00:33:28,440
You're wrong again.

462
00:33:28,480 --> 00:33:29,680
We don't need to

463
00:33:29,720 --> 00:33:30,980
forge the edict at all.

464
00:33:31,400 --> 00:33:33,110
I just need to kill you

465
00:33:33,480 --> 00:33:34,750
and Bai Qi.

466
00:33:34,880 --> 00:33:36,480
With the edict left hanging,

467
00:33:36,590 --> 00:33:37,640
the only one

468
00:33:38,000 --> 00:33:39,550
to inherit the throne

469
00:33:40,160 --> 00:33:42,160
will be the Fourth Prince.

470
00:33:53,480 --> 00:33:54,750
Zhao Shanlei.

471
00:33:55,590 --> 00:33:58,000
I'll kill you today

472
00:33:58,640 --> 00:34:00,820
to uphold the honor of Great Shi!

473
00:34:46,580 --> 00:34:47,710
Fourth Prince.

474
00:34:49,030 --> 00:34:50,960
You're indeed ruthless.

475
00:34:52,000 --> 00:34:53,260
That's cold-blooded.

476
00:34:56,760 --> 00:35:00,400
See to it that Xuanyuan Shan's body
is properly disposed of.

477
00:35:03,360 --> 00:35:05,410
Once I ascend the throne,

478
00:35:06,190 --> 00:35:07,710
I'll use her corpse

479
00:35:08,940 --> 00:35:10,400
to avenge this grudge.

480
00:35:14,710 --> 00:35:15,760
As expected.

481
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:20,880
As expected, you're a fine disciple

482
00:35:20,880 --> 00:35:23,190
trained by Li San.

483
00:35:29,760 --> 00:35:30,670
Come with me.

484
00:35:31,590 --> 00:35:33,030
Someone wants to see you.

485
00:36:00,590 --> 00:36:02,120
Greetings, Your Holiness.

486
00:36:02,590 --> 00:36:03,880
Envoy Zhao said

487
00:36:04,150 --> 00:36:07,320
Li Si killed Xuanyuan Shan
with his own hands

488
00:36:07,360 --> 00:36:10,060
to show his loyalty to Liluo.

489
00:36:10,400 --> 00:36:11,420
Exactly.

490
00:36:11,760 --> 00:36:13,440
I saw it with my own eyes

491
00:36:13,440 --> 00:36:15,300
and have verified it thoroughly.

492
00:36:15,360 --> 00:36:16,360
Xuanyuan Shan

493
00:36:17,070 --> 00:36:18,320
is dead.

494
00:36:19,080 --> 00:36:21,900
With Bai Qi and Xuanyuan Shan dead,

495
00:36:22,190 --> 00:36:24,250
our great plan is half accomplished.

496
00:36:25,000 --> 00:36:26,800
Bring Li Si in.

497
00:36:27,010 --> 00:36:28,220
You may leave now.

498
00:36:28,430 --> 00:36:29,220
-Yes.
-Yes.

499
00:36:38,470 --> 00:36:40,220
The Holy Queen summons you.

500
00:37:04,960 --> 00:37:05,890
Second Brother?

501
00:37:05,920 --> 00:37:06,720
My beloved...

502
00:37:22,480 --> 00:37:23,280
It's you,

503
00:37:24,280 --> 00:37:25,500
Crown Princess.

504
00:37:26,110 --> 00:37:27,640
Your Highness Prince Xian.

505
00:37:28,400 --> 00:37:30,280
Why is it that
you haven't paid your respects

506
00:37:30,280 --> 00:37:31,810
to me, your sister-in-law?

507
00:38:05,800 --> 00:38:06,840
Tianmoluo.

508
00:38:07,670 --> 00:38:09,130
The fruit of immortality.

509
00:38:09,710 --> 00:38:10,510
So

510
00:38:11,320 --> 00:38:13,120
the fruit of immortality may not

511
00:38:13,120 --> 00:38:14,580
truly grant immortality,

512
00:38:15,400 --> 00:38:16,790
but it can preserve

513
00:38:17,230 --> 00:38:18,760
one's youthful appearance

514
00:38:19,190 --> 00:38:20,920
and reverse the signs of aging.

515
00:38:41,480 --> 00:38:42,280
Chief.

516
00:38:42,590 --> 00:38:44,550
This wound pierced
straight through your heart.

517
00:38:44,550 --> 00:38:47,150
How did you manage to hide it
from Zhao Shanlei?

518
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:51,560
Prince Xian avoided my vitals,

519
00:38:53,110 --> 00:38:55,220
and I held my breath to feign death.

520
00:38:59,840 --> 00:39:01,340
Did His Highness Prince Xian

521
00:39:01,340 --> 00:39:02,800
send you here to assist me?

522
00:39:02,800 --> 00:39:03,480
Yes.

523
00:39:07,000 --> 00:39:09,800
The enemy was in the dark
while we were in the clear.

524
00:39:10,440 --> 00:39:12,730
Prince Xian and I devised a plan

525
00:39:13,710 --> 00:39:15,800
for him to feign an attempt on my life,

526
00:39:16,630 --> 00:39:18,400
all to gain the trust

527
00:39:18,800 --> 00:39:20,920
of Liluo's Dark Night.

528
00:39:21,280 --> 00:39:22,280
In that case,

529
00:39:22,710 --> 00:39:23,550
His Highness Prince Xian

530
00:39:23,550 --> 00:39:24,480
should have met

531
00:39:24,480 --> 00:39:26,140
the Holy Queen of Liluo by now.

532
00:39:28,190 --> 00:39:30,070
Now that you've seen me,

533
00:39:30,280 --> 00:39:31,280
and there're only

534
00:39:31,440 --> 00:39:33,190
the two of us...

535
00:39:35,110 --> 00:39:36,360
and that dog here,

536
00:39:37,110 --> 00:39:39,230
now is your best chance.

537
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:42,760
Why haven't you made your move?

538
00:39:42,920 --> 00:39:44,850
I've already killed Xuanyuan Shan

539
00:39:45,000 --> 00:39:46,260
to show my allegiance.

540
00:39:46,440 --> 00:39:48,590
Do you still not trust me, Holy Queen?

541
00:39:49,630 --> 00:39:51,710
I can't care less whether Xuanyuan Shan

542
00:39:51,710 --> 00:39:54,030
is truly dead or not,

543
00:39:54,310 --> 00:39:55,220
nor do I care

544
00:39:55,800 --> 00:39:58,110
if your intentions are genuine.

545
00:39:58,480 --> 00:39:59,610
I simply dare not bet

546
00:39:59,620 --> 00:40:02,080
on the unpredictability
of the human heart.

547
00:40:03,400 --> 00:40:04,960
What concerns me is that

548
00:40:06,630 --> 00:40:08,830
once the Liluo people see through this,

549
00:40:09,630 --> 00:40:12,090
His Highness's life
will be in grave danger.

550
00:40:12,630 --> 00:40:13,630
Or,

551
00:40:14,840 --> 00:40:15,920
if the Holy Queen

552
00:40:16,800 --> 00:40:20,030
insists on activating
the Ten Thousand Gu Devouring Heart,

553
00:40:20,030 --> 00:40:21,630
His Highness Prince Xian

554
00:40:23,230 --> 00:40:25,320
will likely meet a tragic end.

555
00:40:30,840 --> 00:40:33,320
This plan is far too perilous.

556
00:40:35,630 --> 00:40:37,090
At this point, all we can do

557
00:40:37,280 --> 00:40:39,280
is leave it to fate.

558
00:40:40,920 --> 00:40:43,110
The human heart is indeed
difficult to fathom.

559
00:40:43,110 --> 00:40:45,710
For the sake of
restoring Liluo's great cause,

560
00:40:45,840 --> 00:40:47,800
Holy Queen, you were even
willing to sacrifice

561
00:40:47,800 --> 00:40:48,670
your own son,

562
00:40:49,280 --> 00:40:50,880
Zhou Ye.

563
00:40:51,320 --> 00:40:52,720
With such ruthlessness,

564
00:40:52,880 --> 00:40:54,400
even my father

565
00:40:54,920 --> 00:40:56,580
would have to concede defeat.

566
00:40:57,280 --> 00:40:58,110
No wonder

567
00:40:58,800 --> 00:40:59,840
the Great Shi

568
00:41:00,710 --> 00:41:02,770
will ultimately perish by your hand.

569
00:41:09,880 --> 00:41:10,630
Do you really think

570
00:41:10,630 --> 00:41:13,480
